;
; This file is the machine-readable authority for the atomic MEM-* rule
; population currently defined by Runtime & Memory v0.3.
;
; Consumers SHALL define:
;
;   ASMWEB_RUNTIME_RULE token,
;                       rule_id,
;                       namespace,
;                       definition_status,
;                       qualification_state,
;                       normative_statement
;
; before including this file.
;
